  "ruleText": "He-P 3011.04 Wear of Protective Headgear. All individuals under the age of 16 shall wear protective headgear pursuant to RSA 265:144, X.\n\nSource. #8524, eff 1-1-06; ss by #10529, eff 2-27-14",
